data: {"type":"recall","hits":[{"id":"mem-1","text":"Target (TGT) revenue went from $109.12B (FY ending 2023-01-28) to $106.57B (FY ending 2025-02-01), a -2.3% change; YoY growth was -1.57% (FY ending 2024-02-03), -0.79% (FY ending 2025-02-01) [ev-1].","score":0.20343079317760138,"provenance":{"source":"causa:investigation/inv-5","confidence":0.9,"derivedFrom":["inv-5/ev-1","zetaris:query/80f4ea1f-680b-4684-8d9a-f039233de587"]}},{"id":"mem-6","text":"Sector-wide: Ford Motor (F)'s SIC 3711 peers excluding F grew 12.77% (fiscal_year 2023), 6.15% (fiscal_year 2024), -1.85% (fiscal_year 2025) in aggregate, versus F's 11.47% (fiscal_year 2023), 5.00% (fiscal_year 2024), 1.23% (fiscal_year 2025), so the industry moved the same way [ev-2].","score":0.19543359026997803,"provenance":{"source":"causa:investigation/inv-6","confidence":0.9,"derivedFrom":["inv-6/ev-2","zetaris:query/00e85bfe-075e-4546-9b85-5a9da3f02c71"]}},{"id":"mem-3","text":"Margin trade-off: Target (TGT)'s operating margin rose from 3.53% (FY ending 2023-01-28) to 5.22% (FY ending 2025-02-01) while its revenue growth lagged, consistent with prioritising profitability over sales [ev-4].","score":0.17565533869146094,"provenance":{"source":"causa:investigation/inv-5","confidence":0.7,"derivedFrom":["inv-5/ev-4","zetaris:query/d05fd8e2-eb32-4ac8-aa18-8434f45938a7"]}},{"id":"mem-2","text":"Company-specific: over fiscal_year 2023, 2024 Target (TGT) grew -1.57% and -0.79% YoY while its SIC 5331 peers grew faster: WMT 6.03% and 5.07%; COST 6.76% and 5.02%; DG 2.24% and 4.96% [ev-1].","score":0.17099996941965329,"provenance":{"source":"causa:investigation/inv-5","confidence":0.9,"derivedFrom":["inv-5/ev-1","zetaris:query/80f4ea1f-680b-4684-8d9a-f039233de587"]}},{"id":"mem-10","text":"Not a margin trade-off: Ford Motor (F)'s operating margin also fell, from 3.97% (FY ending 2022-12-31) to -4.90% (FY ending 2025-12-31) [ev-4].","score":0.1628891044917891,"provenance":{"source":"causa:investigation/inv-6","confidence":0